WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.050
The first Drive Impact crumples the opponent.

2
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.700
Dhalsim backdashes after the crumple.

3
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.300
Drive Rush light slide carries Dhalsim underneath the airborne opponent.

4
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:03.800
Standing light punch catches the opponent after the side change.

5
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:04.750
Dhalsim immediately uses another Drive Impact as a reset attempt.

6
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.050
The second Drive Impact reaches the opponent at the source’s reset timing.
